{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/ebd46952c00909a702c714ecf04becc3.avif?t=1758070795\" width=617 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/85c901b9b37c96ca18331b04f3eac78a.poster.avif?t=1758070795\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/85c901b9b37c96ca18331b04f3eac78a.webm?t=1758070795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/85c901b9b37c96ca18331b04f3eac78a.mp4?t=1758070795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1758070795\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baiacool \u2013 Tides of Olympus</strong> puts you in the skin (okay, scales) of a <strong>pufferfish</strong> on a quest to find Poseidon after receiving a cryptic message. Explore Greek god temples, solve puzzles, and fight enemies using a <strong>mystical stick</strong> (<span class=\"bb_strike\">he <i>insists</i> on being called that</span>) who just won\u2019t shut up. Uncover who's behind all of this \u2013 by saying just one word\u2026 <strong>cool</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/52799b901e69cf3052b21cd32251a367.poster.avif?t=1758070795\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/52799b901e69cf3052b21cd32251a367.webm?t=1758070795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/52799b901e69cf3052b21cd32251a367.mp4?t=1758070795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797250/extras/cf2717fc97dcc30a66c1edd3216ebee3.webp?t=1758070795\" width=615 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A marine adventure (that doesn't feel like a water level) where the entire Greek pantheon somehow ended up underwater.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Greek temples, fight tons of enemies, and uncover epic secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that would make even Daedalus lose his cool.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because you\u2019re a pufferfish doesn\u2019t mean you\u2019re off the hook from facing Greek gods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet famous mythological characters (if Achilles were a fish, where would his heel be???)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help out underwater locals with their weird problems and obviously, get something in return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is full of epic items. What do they do? No idea. But \u201cepic\u201d sounds promising.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a bunch of outfits, weapons, and powers to prove Hecate\u2019s not the only one pulling magical sea bunnies out of a hat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the depths of Greek mythology\u00a0 and don\u2019t just float around clueless.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi